      "spam": false,
      "value": "From the 2018.1.2 release notes: \"Teleporting or loading into a world will no longer preserve your previous rotation vector and will instead match the spawn location transform rotation as intended.\"\n\nI believe this fixed the issue being mentioned here. If the bug still exists, please reply and I'll set the status back.",
