  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I keep falling out of many different worlds when I go through doors since the new update. It seems to be related to not being completely centered in the play area. So, if I'm sitting on my couch I end up spawning that distance difference in game and fall out of the world. This only happens when the new update came out.",
